# Shadmink Logos
#
# The Shadmink Crafts and Shadmink Travel marks side by side, each with its
# wordmark. Self-contained: the two logos are stored below as pixel data
# (6 hex digits per pixel, "......" = transparent), so there are no image
# files to upload. Static art: nothing is fetched.
#
# Layout (192 wide, safe zone x 10-181):
#   x 10-90   CRAFTS mark + "SHADMINK / CRAFTS"
#   x 93      thin divider
#   x 96-180  TRAVEL mark + "SHADMINK / TRAVEL"

